  "notes": "8-channel headphone mixing and distribution amplifier (19\" rack, IEC mains). Two stereo MAIN IN pairs (6.35 mm TRS); each channel selects MAIN IN 1 or 2. A cable in a channel's DIRECT IN mutes the main signal for that channel. The guide mentions an extra rear PHONES OUT per channel, the specifications list 8 headphone outputs; the rear jacks are not listed. Controls from the Quick Start Guide (HA8000/HA6000): level knobs MAIN IN 1 and 2, per channel IN 1/IN 2 button (which MAIN input the channel hears), MONO and OUTPUT LEVEL, and POWER. A cable in DIRECT IN mutes the MAIN inputs on that channel. Assumption: levels at MIN are silent.",
